{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium Apple-inspired card slider section similar to Apple's "Get to know iPhone" experience.
    
    The section should contain exactly 4 cards arranged horizontally.
    
    ## Section Header
    
    Add:
    
    * Optional category label
    * Large title aligned to the left
    * Optional subtitle below the title
    
    All typography must feel premium and Apple-like.
    
    ---
    
    # Card Layout
    
    Each card should contain:
    
    1. Small category label
    2. Large headline
    3. Optional description text
    4. Large image area
    
    Hierarchy:
    
    Category
    
    ↓
    
    Headline
    
    ↓
    
    Description
    
    ↓
    
    Image
    
    ---
    
    # Images
    
    For each card create:
    
    * Desktop image
    * Mobile image
    
    Desktop image appears only on desktop.
    
    Mobile image appears only on mobile.
    
    Very important:
    
    * Image container must use a fixed 1:1 aspect ratio.
    * All cards must use exactly the same image dimensions.
    * Use object-fit: cover.
    * Images should fill the image container completely.
    * No stretching.
    * No excessive empty space around the image.
    * Image size should determine the card proportions.
    * Image containers must align perfectly across every card.
    
    ---
    
    # Card Dimensions
    
    Very important:
    
    * All cards must have identical width and height.
    * Cards should not be overly tall.
    * Remove excessive whitespace.
    * Use balanced Apple-style spacing.
    * Image should be the primary visual element.
    * Cards should feel compact and premium.
    
    ---
    
    # Card Borders
    
    Very important:
    
    * Card borders must be perfectly continuous.
    * No broken borders.
    * No missing top border.
    * Rounded corners should remain smooth.
    * Border radius should apply consistently on all four sides.
    * Prevent border clipping and overflow issues.
    
    ---
    
    # Slider Behavior
    
    Very important:
    
    The slider should feel extremely smooth.
    
    Enable:
    
    * Finger swipe on mobile.
    * Mouse dragging on desktop.
    * CSS scroll snap.
    * Momentum scrolling.
    * Smooth transitions.
    
    Use:
    
    * -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch
    * touch-action: pan-x
    
    Requirements:
    
    * Mobile swipe should feel effortless.
    * Prevent sticky dragging.
    * Prevent vertical page scrolling from blocking horizontal swipes.
    * Cards should snap cleanly after finger release.
    * iPhone Safari and Android Chrome should behave smoothly.
    
    ---
    
    # Navigation
    
    Remove arrow buttons completely.
    
    Only use pagination dots.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * No previous button.
    * No next button.
    * Navigation relies on swipe gestures and dots only.
    
    ---
    
    # Pagination Dots
    
    Create small Apple-style dots.
    
    * Dot size around 6px.
    * Active dot around 7–8px.
    * Small spacing between dots.
    * Elegant appearance.
    
    Allow editing:
    
    * Dot size
    * Dot spacing
    * Dot color
    * Active dot color
    
    ---
    
    # Customization Settings
    
    Create Shopify settings for EVERYTHING.
    
    ## Colors
    
    * Section background color
    * Card background color
    * Border color
    * Category text color
    * Headline color
    * Description color
    * Dot color
    * Active dot color
    
    ## Typography
    
    Create separate desktop and mobile controls for:
    
    * Category size
    * Title size
    * Subtitle size
    * Card category size
    * Card headline size
    * Card description size
    
    ## Layout
    
    * Card width
    * Card height
    * Card spacing
    * Card border radius
    * Image border radius
    * Section top padding
    * Section bottom padding
    * Left padding
    * Right padding
    
    ## Slider
    
    * Dot size
    * Dot spacing
    * Autoplay enable/disable
    * Transition speed
    
    ---
    
    # Per Card Settings
    
    For each of the 4 cards create:
    
    * Category text
    * Headline text
    * Description text
    * Desktop image
    * Mobile image
    
    Use Shopify image pickers, color pickers, text fields and range sliders.
    
    Default appearance should remain premium, minimal and closely inspired by Apple's "Get to know iPhone" cards.
    , Keep the current design exactly the same.
    
    Only fix the image fitting inside the card.
    
    The uploaded image is currently not filling the image area correctly.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * The image must completely fill the image container inside the card.
    * The image container must stay inside the card padding.
    * The image should not leave large empty space.
    * The image should not overflow outside the card.
    * Use `width: 100%`.
    * Use `height: 100%`.
    * Use `object-fit: cover`.
    * Use `display: block`.
    * The image container should use a fixed 1:1 aspect ratio.
    * All four cards must use the exact same image container size.
    * The image container should align perfectly with the card width.
    * Keep the image border radius consistent.
    
    Do not change the card design, text, colors, typography, slider behavior or dots.
    
    Only make the uploaded images fit perfectly inside the card image area., Keep the current design exactly the same.
    
    Only fix the proportion between the card and the image area.
    
    The image area is currently not balanced inside the card.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * Make the image area wider and more proportional to the card.
    * The image container should use almost the full available card width.
    * Keep equal left and right padding inside the card.
    * Maintain a fixed 1:1 square aspect ratio.
    * The image should sit closer to the text, with less empty vertical space.
    * Reduce unnecessary empty space below the image.
    * The card should feel balanced: text area on top, image area below.
    * Image area should occupy around 55–65% of the card height.
    * All 4 cards must have identical card size and identical image size.
    * Use `object-fit: cover` and `width: 100%; height: 100%;`.
    
    Do not change typography, colors, dots, slider behavior or card border radius.
    
    Only adjust the card/image proportions so the card looks premium and balanced.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-card-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_bg_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.header_category_size_desktop }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.header_category_color }};
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.header_title_size_desktop }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.header_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: {%- assign tt_ls = block.settings.header_title_size_mobile -%}{%- if tt_ls >= 28 -%}-1px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 20 -%}-0.8px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 16 -%}-0.3px{%- else -%}normal{%- endif -%};
  }

  .ai-card-slider-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.header_subtitle_size_desktop }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.header_subtitle_color }};
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    overflow-y: hidden;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    touch-action: pan-x;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 {{ block.settings.card_width }}px;
    min-width: {{ block.settings.card_width }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.card_height }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_bg_color }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 20px 16px 12px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-card-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_category_size_desktop }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_category_color }};
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-card-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_headline_size_desktop }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_headline_color }};
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: {%- assign tt_ls = block.settings.card_headline_size_mobile -%}{%- if tt_ls >= 28 -%}-1px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 20 -%}-0.8px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 16 -%}-0.3px{%- else -%}normal{%- endif -%};
  }

  .ai-card-slider-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_description_size_desktop }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_description_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: calc(100% - 32px);
    margin: 0 16px 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    padding-top: 100%;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-card-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-card-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.dot_spacing }}px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.dot_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.dot_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dot_color }};
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-card-slider-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    width: {{ block.settings.dot_size | plus: 2 }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.dot_size | plus: 2 }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dot_active_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-card-slider-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.header_category_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-card-slider-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.header_title_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-card-slider-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.header_subtitle_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-card-slider-card-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.card_category_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-card-slider-card-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.card_headline_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-card-slider-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.card_description_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-card-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 85%;
      min-width: 85%;
    }

    .ai-card-slider-card-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-card-slider-card-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<apple-card-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-card-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-card-slider-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.header_category != blank or block.settings.header_title != blank or block.settings.header_subtitle != blank %}
      <div class="ai-card-slider-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.header_category != blank %}
          <div class="ai-card-slider-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.header_category }}</div>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.header_title != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-card-slider-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.header_title }}</h2>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.header_subtitle != blank %}
          <div class="ai-card-slider-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.header_subtitle }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-card-slider-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-card-slider-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-slider-track>
        {% for i in (1..4) %}
          {% liquid
            assign card_category_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_category'
            assign card_headline_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_headline'
            assign card_description_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_description'
            assign card_image_desktop_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_image_desktop'
            assign card_image_mobile_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_image_mobile'

            assign card_category = block.settings[card_category_key]
            assign card_headline = block.settings[card_headline_key]
            assign card_description = block.settings[card_description_key]
            assign card_image_desktop = block.settings[card_image_desktop_key]
            assign card_image_mobile = block.settings[card_image_mobile_key]
          %}

          <div class="ai-card-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-card-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}">
            <div class="ai-card-slider-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if card_category != blank %}
                <div class="ai-card-slider-card-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_category }}</div>
              {% endif %}
              {% if card_headline != blank %}
                <h3 class="ai-card-slider-card-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_headline }}</h3>
              {% endif %}
              {% if card_description != blank %}
                <div class="ai-card-slider-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_description }}</div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            <div class="ai-card-slider-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if card_image_desktop %}
                <img
                  src="{{ card_image_desktop | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                  alt="{{ card_image_desktop.alt | escape }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="{{ card_image_desktop.width }}"
                  height="{{ card_image_desktop.height }}"
                  class="ai-card-slider-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-card-slider-card-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-card-slider-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-card-slider-card-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}

              {% if card_image_mobile %}
                <img
                  src="{{ card_image_mobile | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                  alt="{{ card_image_mobile.alt | escape }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="{{ card_image_mobile.width }}"
                  height="{{ card_image_mobile.height }}"
                  class="ai-card-slider-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-card-slider-card-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                >
              {% elsif card_image_desktop %}
                <img
                  src="{{ card_image_desktop | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                  alt="{{ card_image_desktop.alt | escape }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="{{ card_image_desktop.width }}"
                  height="{{ card_image_desktop.height }}"
                  class="ai-card-slider-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-card-slider-card-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-card-slider-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-card-slider-card-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-card-slider-pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-pagination>
      {% for i in (1..4) %}
        <button
          class="ai-card-slider-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if forloop.first %}active{% endif %}"
          data-dot-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
          aria-label="Go to slide {{ forloop.index }}"
        ></button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</apple-card-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class AppleCardSlider{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.track = null;
        this.dots = [];
        this.cards = [];
        this.currentIndex = 0;
        this.autoplayInterval = null;
        this.isDragging = false;
        this.startX = 0;
        this.scrollLeft = 0;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.track = this.querySelector('[data-slider-track]');
        this.dots = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('[data-dot-index]'));
        this.cards = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('[data-card-index]'));

        if (!this.track || this.dots.length === 0) return;

        this.setupEventListeners();
        this.updateActiveDot(0);

        {% if block.settings.autoplay_enabled %}
          this.startAutoplay();
        {% endif %}
      }

      disconnectedCallback() {
        this.stopAutoplay();
      }

      setupEventListeners() {
        this.dots.forEach((dot) => {
          dot.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const index = parseInt(dot.getAttribute('data-dot-index'));
            this.scrollToCard(index);
            this.stopAutoplay();
          });
        });

        this.track.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
          this.handleScroll();
        });

        this.track.addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => this.handleDragStart(e));
        this.track.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => this.handleDragMove(e));
        this.track.addEventListener('mouseup', () => this.handleDragEnd());
        this.track.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => this.handleDragEnd());

        this.track.addEventListener('touchstart', () => {
          this.stopAutoplay();
        });
      }

      handleDragStart(e) {
        this.isDragging = true;
        this.startX = e.pageX - this.track.offsetLeft;
        this.scrollLeft = this.track.scrollLeft;
        this.track.style.cursor = 'grabbing';
        this.stopAutoplay();
      }

      handleDragMove(e) {
        if (!this.isDragging) return;
        e.preventDefault();
        const x = e.pageX - this.track.offsetLeft;
        const walk = (x - this.startX) * 2;
        this.track.scrollLeft = this.scrollLeft - walk;
      }

      handleDragEnd() {
        this.isDragging = false;
        this.track.style.cursor = 'grab';
      }

      handleScroll() {
        const scrollLeft = this.track.scrollLeft;
        const cardWidth = this.cards[0].offsetWidth;
        const gap = {{ block.settings.card_spacing }};
        const index = Math.round(scrollLeft / (cardWidth + gap));
        
        if (index !== this.currentIndex) {
          this.currentIndex = index;
          this.updateActiveDot(index);
        }
      }

      scrollToCard(index) {
        if (index < 0 || index >= this.cards.length) return;
        
        const card = this.cards[index];
        const cardWidth = card.offsetWidth;
        const gap = {{ block.settings.card_spacing }};
        const scrollPosition = index * (cardWidth + gap);
        
        this.track.scrollTo({
          left: scrollPosition,
          behavior: 'smooth'
        });
        
        this.currentIndex = index;
        this.updateActiveDot(index);
      }

      updateActiveDot(index) {
        this.dots.forEach((dot, i) => {
          if (i === index) {
            dot.classList.add('active');
          } else {
            dot.classList.remove('active');
          }
        });
      }

      startAutoplay() {
        {% if block.settings.autoplay_enabled %}
          const speed = {{ block.settings.transition_speed }} * 1000;
          this.autoplayInterval = setInterval(() => {
            let nextIndex = this.currentIndex + 1;
            if (nextIndex >= this.cards.length) {
              nextIndex = 0;
            }
            this.scrollToCard(nextIndex);
          }, speed);
        {% endif %}
      }

      stopAutoplay() {
        if (this.autoplayInterval) {
          clearInterval(this.autoplayInterval);
          this.autoplayInterval = null;
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('apple-card-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}', AppleCardSlider{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Apple card slider",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section header"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "header_category",
      "label": "Category label"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "header_title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "Get to know our products"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "header_subtitle",
      "label": "Subtitle"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Header typography - Desktop"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "header_category_size_desktop",
      "label": "Category size",
      "min": 10,
      "max": 30,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 14
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "header_title_size_desktop",
      "label": "Title size",
      "min": 20,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "header_subtitle_size_desktop",
      "label": "Subtitle size",
      "min": 12,
      "max": 32,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 18
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Header typography - Mobile"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "header_category_size_mobile",
      "label": "Category size",
      "min": 10,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "header_title_size_mobile",
      "label": "Title size",
      "min": 16,
      "max": 48,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 32
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "header_subtitle_size_mobile",
      "label": "Subtitle size",
      "min": 12,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Header colors"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "header_category_color",
      "label": "Category",
      "default": "#5c5c57"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "header_title_color",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "#0a0a0a"
    },
    {
